WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.625
If else chooses between two things.

2
00:00:03.553 --> 00:00:06.753
If the question is true, the first part runs.

3
00:00:07.557 --> 00:00:10.507
If it's false, the else part runs instead.

4
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:18.230
Exactly one part runs each time round. Never both, and never neither.
